{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/issues/21","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/issues/21/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/issues/21/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/issues/21/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sentinel-projects/sentinel/issues/21","id":5974131452,"node_id":"I_kwDOSOxi088AAAABZBYC_A","number":21,"title":"P0: Subagents bypass per-step approval (autonomousMode)","user":{"login":"Sopwit","id":131982697,"node_id":"U_kgDOB93laQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131982697?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sopwit","html_url":"https://github.com/Sopwit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sopwit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sopwit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sopwit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sopwit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sopwit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sopwit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sopwit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sopwit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sopwit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10810294273,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSOxi088AAAAChFgAAQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12498429268,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSOxi088AAAAC6PblVA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/labels/component:%20core","name":"component: core","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12786211768,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSOxi088AAAAC-h4buA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/labels/priority:%20critical","name":"priority: critical","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":"Blocks release or security-sensitive","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12786212535,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSOxi088AAAAC-h4etw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/labels/type:%20security","name":"type: security","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":"Security boundary or hardening","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12786212614,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSOxi088AAAAC-h4fBg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/labels/phase:%20p0","name":"phase: p0","color":"000000","default":false,"description":"Baseline/release blocker","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-22T06:15:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:15:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\nDelegated subagents are created with `autonomousMode = true`, and `AgentLoop` approves every step in autonomous mode without consulting the approval policy. A subagent can therefore execute tools that the parent run would have required the user to approve.\n\n## Evidence\n- `core/src/agent/AgentRuntime.cpp:949-954` — subagent config sets `autonomousMode = true`.\n- `core/src/agent/AgentLoop.cpp:953-960` — autonomous mode synthesizes an `Approved` decision with the message \"per-step approval is bypassed\".\n- The subagent tool allow-list is read-only today, but the bypass is a general loop behavior and does not depend on that allow-list.\n\n## Impact\nApproval is not transitive across delegation. A prompt that reaches a subagent can perform approved-class operations without a user prompt, and the run record attributes the action to the subagent rather than to an explicit grant.\n\n## Proposed fix\n- Inherit the parent run's approval policy and permission scope in subagents.\n- If autonomous delegation is desired, require an explicit user grant that names the delegated capability set.\n- Record the delegation and the inherited policy in the run trace.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] A subagent cannot execute an approval-required tool without either an inherited decision or a new prompt.\n- [ ] Autonomous delegation requires an explicit, scoped grant.\n- [ ] Tests cover parent-approved, parent-denied and no-decision paths.\n\n\n---\nPhase: P0 · Source: 2026-10-22 gap analysis @ `d4bff5a2`\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/issues/21/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sentinel-projects/sentinel/issues/21/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}